Integrating
The integration of IoT (Internet of Things) technology with CNC machines has revolutionized industrial machining processes, providing unprecedented levels of accuracy, efficiency and data-driven insights. One of the most promising advancements in this area is the integration of IoT sensors with vitrified CBN wheels in CNC operations. This powerful combination enhances monitoring, control and optimization of the grinding process, improving performance and reducing downtime. In this article, we explore the benefits, applications, and best practices of integrating IoT sensors with vitrified**[ CBN wheels](
)** in CNC machines. Vitrified CBN wheels are renowned for their exceptional hardness, thermal stability, and durability. These wheels are made by bonding CBN abrasives with…
